  "wrap": "Reviewed the higher September metformin charge: records show $8 at preferred retail (Oak Street Pharmacy, August 18, 2026) and $27 at standard retail (Lakeview Pharmacy, September 16, 2026) for the same 30-day metformin 500 mg supply. Confirmed the current Lakeview Pharmacy refill status is ready for pickup. Discussed the 90-day option for eligible existing prescriptions. Submitted CenterWell pharmacy service enrollment for future metformin fills only; atorvastatin remains at retail, and today’s Lakeview refill is unchanged. A coverage case for Jardiance 10 mg tablets is pending review.\n\nConnection result: DEMO-TRANSFER001 — receiving_specialist_connected. DEMO-CVR001 remains pending_review. Connection is not a coverage determination.\n\nDEMO-ENR001 · metformin · ready · DEMO-CVR001",
